Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt your conquerors, Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It resonated through your every punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The technique was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But the execution was sorely lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, keep coming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ro-ro-ro-ro-ro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Another pirate who couldn't be\NJoy Boy, just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wiper brings out a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right All we saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,stormy nights All the rough\Nwinds and waves Coming day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,after day And the values we\Nhad Were about to collapse Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down To the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here knows it for\Ncertain. So close your eyes and breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,in deeply and listen to your soul you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,see a path in front of you and you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,know just where you need to go so stand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,up tall reach out your hand cut through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind and make a stand. Don't let the\Ndarkness sway and just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay to\Nget help on the way For the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,future ahead burning bright\NFor what's ahead you see
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest\Ndreams So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.84,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the best that we know With tears\Nand doubts and toll We'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The pain\Nwithin brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, raccoon, get wrecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He grabbed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's overpowering Twain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, quite so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're breathing awfully hard, Raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're winning this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was that all for show?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is lickety-spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sure been hard to\Ntrack down, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Momonosuke? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got that smug look in his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master's handcuffs are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kozuki Udon after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means that I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot meet my end yet. Meet your end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I said someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who we found, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mama Nosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay dokie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Relay a message to all\Nof Onigashima, Baohuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them my battle\Nagainst Straw Hat is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in struggling any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's firing again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover or you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper Emon, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got less than ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my Rumble Ball's power will wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's longer than before,\Nbut it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really the best you can do? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three minutes is no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems a little half-assed, in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'm a monster for more than ten\Nminutes, there might be some side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But who gives a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do you only care about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Some pirate you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetch me the chemicals I ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The gigantification will be\Nextended to thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ten times longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's risky, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not scared, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a pirate, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Black coffee beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.62,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to sneak away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mary's!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, to Fusion Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have your attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The duel is over, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy with the highest bounty, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,has been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaprima, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kyno chased the life out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Straw Hat Luffy sank like a rock\Ndeeper and deeper into the dark, dark sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha! Good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the idiot drown for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Samurai are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's left?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone else step up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone strong enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped the Samurai too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Kaido is coming\Ndownstairs to clean out his castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that giant hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for nothing but that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But the good news is, our final\Nleader will accept your surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is\Nbe nice and obedient,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,put your hands in the air,\Nand promise not to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you'll be welcomed as a member of\Nour crew, and we won't have to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Mobinosuke! What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to tell everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender, Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a losing battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me say it again for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy was defeated and sank\Nto the bottom of the dark, dark sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This frog is a Mary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's one in the room with\Nus, then it's already too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, anyone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Shinobu, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine reunion this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, he's not real.\NYou're here. You've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not look at him. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the poor boy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heartwarming\Nreunion for our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like poor old Odin anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease your lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've mocked us enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, that's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you put that nasty sword away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still your lord, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster, you killed Arshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really me, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with his face! Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the thanks I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After all I did for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the first meal I\Nshared with you and Izo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't bring yourself to do it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as he said, they couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,God, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have any trouble\Ncutting me down the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we're both\Ncritically injured, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Keen, I have failed\Nyou for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku Nojo of the Fallen Snow\Nshall meet her end this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the Fallen Snow is melting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that means dawn is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To shine on the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that dawn will be\Nso bright that it will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,shine upon our friends in the afterworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku Nojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we had an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely your performance\Nwould get a standing ovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka-ka-ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for\Nyour final scene, Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku! Worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set the stage so\Nthat you die gloriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His lord was killed, and he was\Nbetrayed by his dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Long has he fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And now his comrades fall\Nbefore him one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps it's a comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire audience is waiting in suspense
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,decorate the stage with\Nyour dazzling death
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.78,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not taking this\Nfreak in! Just look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry over and over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What more do you want from me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjino!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sound that\NRaizo makes when he runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another one of his many skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ningpo. Blindfolding technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kanjuro, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you trickster, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one more suited to\Nlower the curtain on my play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you my thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We shared this stage as\Nbest friends, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tale it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, so this is where\Nyou scurried off to, little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu, take Lord Momonosuke\Nand run away! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the odds I face,\NI cannot let you pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be a lie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not here,\Nthen it's all pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's been defeated, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone left\Nwho can take out Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bao Huang's announcement filled\Nthe samurai with uncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And in an instant, their conviction\Nbegan to waver and give way to despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat was defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And Lord Momonosuke, is he safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy won't lose a fight that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima continues its\Njourney through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Soaring over the land of Wano, it\Ndraws ever closer to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,hot damn that little dumpling gave\Nme just the power boost i needed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't do too bad you know those\Nguys you brought are tough as hell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the best pirates from their generation\Nfor sure they didn't lose because
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,they're weak they lost because\Ncommander kaido is just too damn strong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Slicing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Rounds
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Straw Hat is dead, don't\Ngive up till Kaido is defeated. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but Our forces haven't\Nconfirmed Straw Hat's death yet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they made that announcement\Nto crush everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,morale indeed true or not\Nthere's no way to know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this is really pissing me off you\Nthink we're gonna lose that easy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh don't cry now. Who's getting their
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ass kicked all the time, Mr. Wreck, we had
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a good thing going and now you're crying\Non the floor like a big hairy baby
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.56,0:23:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the shepherd is slain and now\Nall his sheep are left to the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,wolves that means it's time for\Na lickety feast how sweet it is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,damn it here he goes again\Napocalyptic candy shower
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's noisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.42,0:24:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You sorry excuse for a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.74,0:24:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the menu, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That meat looks nice and Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.00,0:24:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablish, Umber!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rotisserie, strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.80,0:25:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You hung in there, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.88,0:25:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.98,0:26:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But...Sufi...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But he made miracles happen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.98,0:26:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after him. What? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji what's this once\Nhe's back he'll have
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the strength of ten\Nmen more like 2,000 men
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.52,0:26:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.43,0:26:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll handle\Nthe stupid-looking dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the one responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.74,0:27:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Judge his little reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.94,0:27:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fearless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the tides haven't turned at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His captain is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he even fighting for anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.02,0:27:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.34,0:27:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I like about you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.00,0:27:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.84,0:27:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.50,0:28:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.86,0:28:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't beaten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not while I still draw breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.72,0:28:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a solemn vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.86,0:28:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not lay a finger\Non Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.30,0:28:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.42,0:28:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.50,0:28:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I make a humble suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.94,0:28:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be uncomfortable for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But from this day forth, call me father.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.76,0:29:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to pretend that\Nyou are my father. That
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.74,0:29:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is correct my lord but\Nit is for your own safety
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.50,0:29:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the enemy must not know\Nyour identity that you
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,are lord odin's son as\Nhis descendant they will
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,surely target you to\Nprevent the kozuki clan from
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.68,0:29:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,ever returning to power\NI pray you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.30,0:29:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.08,0:29:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until this battle is over, call me son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then call me father, Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.10,0:29:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kin'emon. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're still calling him lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.38,0:29:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You two really are quite the hapless pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.62,0:30:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should engage in\Nsome training just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.30,0:30:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, momonosuke, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, momonosuke,\Nmomonosuke, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.26,0:30:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to grasp the concept, but\Nyou mess it up at the end every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend, you're not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too insolent for me to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.16,0:31:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder! Keep!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or father, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should be his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather you be\Ninsolent than flatulent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.98,0:31:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My mouth was open!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my lord, you must live!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.80,0:31:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.88,0:31:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.72,0:31:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of stalling for time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left for him to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.76,0:31:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must protect our\Nlord, as long as we live.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.04,0:31:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.36,0:32:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.36,0:32:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die gracefully, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.46,0:32:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to accept, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.80,0:32:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth will find you in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.24,0:33:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.46,0:33:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.78,0:33:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.18,0:33:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.00,0:33:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Beneath the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.14,0:33:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.36,0:33:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.26,0:33:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo, tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.92,0:33:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.96,0:33:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.54,0:33:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.56,0:34:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message from Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.78,0:34:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in will!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.44,0:34:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.70,0:34:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaido defeated Luffy Taro. I
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,can
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.28,0:34:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,hear his
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Voice now. And he
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.56,0:34:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,promised me that he'll come back
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.02,0:34:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't give up You\Nhave to keep fighting No
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,matter what I know it may\Nbe painful It may be hard
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.58,0:34:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.58,0:34:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you still stand,\Nyou must keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.38,0:34:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lord Momonosuke wants\Nus to fight, let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.70,0:34:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we're still standing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.16,0:35:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
